# NAME: ParsecP2P
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Surge external RULE-SET
# FORMAT-VERIFIED: 2026-10-25
# RULES: 4
# POLICY: DIRECT when importing; place before Parsec proxy rule set.
# COMPAT: PROCESS-NAME is Surge Mac only; SRC-PORT 9000 can match unrelated UDP traffic.
# WARNING: These rules cannot guarantee a P2P connection through CGNAT or restrictive firewalls.

DOMAIN,stun.parsec.app
DOMAIN,stun6.parsec.app
AND,((PROCESS-NAME,parsecd),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
AND,((SRC-PORT,9000),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
